WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Auto-reply”.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Start with a custom step
Choose WhatsApp, then press “Custom step”. We will build the flow manually instead of using a ready template.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Write the welcome
Choose “Send a message”. Name the step “Store welcome” and write: Welcome, how can we help you? Then press “Add step”.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Add the prices reply
Add a new message step named “Prices”, write the service details, then save it.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Add the transfer to support
Add a step of type “Transfer to a team” and choose the customer service team. Prepare the team first from the Teams page if it doesn't appear.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Create the options list
Add “Send a short list”, write the customer's question, then a “Prices” option and a “Talk to support” option.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Link each option
From the first option's link list choose “Prices”, and from the second option's link choose the support transfer step, then add the step.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Link the welcome to the list
Open the welcome step, choose the list in “Link to step”, then save the change.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:23.000
Review and turn on
Review the arrows, the options and the customer-facing texts, then turn on the auto-reply switch for the channel. The account in the video is a training account and doesn't send to real customers.
